WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:31.730 --> 01:35.030
The Dance of Knights.

01:35.030 --> 01:36.200
Let's PNP! Aim for PPP!

01:36.850 --> 01:41.650
Students and teachers.

01:41.650 --> 01:47.290
The school party which Rosenburg Knights' Academy is deeply proud of,

01:47.290 --> 01:51.850
the party for the eve of Prism Night Party will start soon.

01:51.850 --> 01:58.880
This year, as usual, we'll elect the honorable Prism Night Prince and Princess.

01:58.880 --> 02:01.760
As was expected, this year will feature an acting contest.

02:02.220 --> 02:07.810
The boy and girl who get to play the title
characters will be the honorable PPP.

02:08.410 --> 02:10.850
The rules of the contest are very simple.

02:10.850 --> 02:16.300
The persons who succeed in grabbing a Breast Armor will get the right to the election.

02:18.190 --> 02:22.120
Wah! Everyone looks ready to kill.

02:22.120 --> 02:25.040
However, just grabbing them is not enough.

02:25.480 --> 02:27.150
Look over there.

02:29.550 --> 02:34.350
Only those who can match the shape of the silhouettes while wearing the Breast Armor...

02:34.350 --> 02:37.090
are able to be elected as the honorable PPP.

02:38.840 --> 02:41.050
But, please take note,

02:41.050 --> 02:44.100
the silhouettes will change from time to time.

02:44.350 --> 02:48.460
We already know the rules, so let's start already, Ms. Litte.

02:48.460 --> 02:51.810
This concerns my life and lunches.

02:52.500 --> 02:55.570
You bring up a valid point, Acty.

02:55.570 --> 02:58.350
The elected one will not only possess the honor,

02:58.350 --> 03:05.140
but also the Eternal Free Pass, abbreviated EFP, for the special lunch.

03:05.140 --> 03:11.410
Are there any prizes more inspirational to growing youths than these?

03:11.410 --> 03:12.910
No. None.

03:12.910 --> 03:14.310
Full stop!

03:14.310 --> 03:15.040
How cruel!

03:15.290 --> 03:17.230
Eternal Free Pass.

03:17.230 --> 03:19.050
EFP.

03:19.570 --> 03:22.660
We can't afford to lose. Can't.

03:22.660 --> 03:24.720
EFP.

03:29.150 --> 03:32.560
You're so sneaky posing without me. Sneaky.

03:36.950 --> 03:39.390
The trial for PPP...

03:39.390 --> 03:42.130
The fight for the Breast Armor...

03:42.130 --> 03:43.820
Start!

03:47.590 --> 03:49.000
It's fabulous!

03:49.000 --> 03:51.080
The game starts at last.

03:51.080 --> 03:54.830
In that case, let's do our very best,
so that we won't have any regrets.

03:55.050 --> 03:57.260
Our... best!

03:58.730 --> 04:00.160
Danger.

04:00.160 --> 04:02.050
Hey, you're too late.

04:02.710 --> 04:03.750
Let's go.

04:03.750 --> 04:04.690
Yes.

04:07.350 --> 04:09.230
You-

04:09.230 --> 04:11.510
Lady Priecia, please.

04:11.510 --> 04:14.110
You're already the real princess,

04:14.110 --> 04:18.610
so can you give PPP to us?

04:19.150 --> 04:20.240
I can't do that-

04:20.240 --> 04:22.940
Hyaweh, wait for me!

04:22.940 --> 04:25.670
I won't give up!!

04:24.700 --> 04:25.670
Hey!

04:28.750 --> 04:29.620
Wait for me.

04:30.230 --> 04:34.760
My plan is to use PPP as a stepping stone to enroll in the local knight brigade.

04:34.760 --> 04:36.460
I'm betting my future on this.

04:36.880 --> 04:39.130
You're quite the pragmatist.

04:39.690 --> 04:41.630
You two. please don't leave me behind—

04:50.290 --> 04:53.140
They're white, white I say...

04:56.990 --> 04:58.740
Sorry, Hyaweh...

04:58.740 --> 05:01.970
No, I'm not. I won't surrender PPP to anyone.

05:01.970 --> 05:06.650
No way. Starting today, I'll be the main character!

05:06.650 --> 05:08.660
How could you understand how people in support—

05:10.350 --> 05:11.870
The armor...

05:12.610 --> 05:16.370
Hyaweh! Where are you, Hyaweh?!

05:17.770 --> 05:20.880
Out of my way!

05:21.010 --> 05:24.010
What are you doing? Don't touch me!

05:24.650 --> 05:28.010
Mirage Lash!

05:32.080 --> 05:33.350
The armor is...

05:33.350 --> 05:34.950
That's the male armor...

05:34.950 --> 05:35.940
After it!

05:40.150 --> 05:41.210
Hyaweh!

05:41.210 --> 05:42.940
I'm h-here.

05:43.520 --> 05:46.650
Are you here to help me, Priecia?

05:47.170 --> 05:48.180
Go for it.

05:48.180 --> 05:49.230
Huh?

05:49.230 --> 05:51.920
Go get that Breast Armor.

05:51.920 --> 05:55.350
I can either kill you now or you can die in the combat.

05:55.660 --> 05:57.170
One or the other.

06:00.740 --> 06:03.170
Orichi's are white, too.

06:03.870 --> 06:06.170
It seems that you want to die.

06:06.300 --> 06:08.920
Okay. I'm going for it.

06:11.740 --> 06:14.020
How could he be this miserable?

06:15.620 --> 06:17.190
White... They're white.

06:22.520 --> 06:26.080
Where's the Princess Armor?

06:32.140 --> 06:34.340
Now that I've made it this far, I can relax.

06:34.340 --> 06:36.900
Now, PPP will be mine.

06:36.900 --> 06:40.260
I see. I forgot about you, stagehand.

06:42.430 --> 06:46.470
What? Isn't it Instructor Karin?

06:46.470 --> 06:49.720
You not only wrote the script for the play,

06:49.720 --> 06:51.480
but you also want the leading role?

06:51.810 --> 06:55.290
B-But, as a woman, don't you understand the desire...

06:55.290 --> 06:57.420
to act like a princess?

06:57.420 --> 07:01.190
I do understand, which is why I followed you here.

07:01.980 --> 07:06.190
Give it to me. Only I, and I alone, deserve to wear that armor.

07:06.760 --> 07:08.190
How could this be...

07:08.650 --> 07:12.050
Though I've been raised in the ways of the sword,

07:12.050 --> 07:15.200
even I want to act like a normal girl sometimes!

07:15.680 --> 07:17.200
H-How so?

07:17.660 --> 07:20.330
Mibu style, hidden sword technique!

07:24.040 --> 07:25.850
Ms. Litte!

07:27.450 --> 07:29.720
Prism Bomber!

07:30.960 --> 07:33.970
You're in on this too, Ms. Litte?

07:34.580 --> 07:40.240
Sorry. I wanted to take this chance to let myself flourish.

07:40.240 --> 07:44.400
Even mature women want to bathe in the spotlight.

07:45.200 --> 07:49.930
Ms. Litte, your breast size belies your words...

07:49.930 --> 07:51.230
You're right.

07:56.430 --> 07:59.440
Give it up, you can't win! Hand it over!

07:59.440 --> 08:01.350
There's no way that would happen!

08:01.350 --> 08:04.250
You two mustn't fight with each other.

08:05.780 --> 08:07.250
Not so fast!

08:10.100 --> 08:12.940
Where's the Prince Armor?

08:21.200 --> 08:23.770
This is a battlefield.

08:23.770 --> 08:27.260
You're right. This place might be a battlefield.

08:27.260 --> 08:28.480
Filia?

08:29.020 --> 08:31.480
You need to fight for what you want.

08:31.480 --> 08:35.320
Onii-chan, fight for a chance at Filia's lips.

08:35.320 --> 08:37.280
Eh? You mean a kiss?!

08:37.630 --> 08:43.870
Yes. Filia has decided to have her first kiss with Onii-chan after becoming PPP.

08:43.870 --> 08:45.340
With me?!

08:45.340 --> 08:50.900
Are you okay with me kissing other people? Well, are you?

08:50.900 --> 08:52.010
W-Well...

08:54.620 --> 08:57.220
Behold, the miracle of love!

08:57.220 --> 09:00.980
At any rate, you'd better hurry to the stage, Onii-chan.

09:00.980 --> 09:02.860
Filia will be right behind you!

09:03.120 --> 09:05.160
Wait a minute, Filia!

09:05.160 --> 09:06.230
She's gone...

09:10.010 --> 09:12.780
Armor... Armor...

09:13.000 --> 09:14.780
S-Stay away!

09:15.170 --> 09:17.780
Hand... it... over...

09:26.950 --> 09:30.500
As long as I can make it over there, PPP will be mine.

09:31.100 --> 09:33.080
Where has it gone?

09:33.080 --> 09:35.530
Someone must have taken it.

09:35.530 --> 09:38.050
Then we'll have to take it back,

09:38.050 --> 09:40.470
by any means necessary...

09:42.190 --> 09:44.830
Orichi is a terrifying girl.

09:44.830 --> 09:47.020
I <i>heard</i> that!

09:47.350 --> 09:48.890
It's over there!

09:48.890 --> 09:51.100
Good! Let's go!

09:51.100 --> 09:52.640
Y-Yes!

09:53.920 --> 09:55.400
Good. Now's my chance.

10:01.680 --> 10:03.480
Bridget.

10:03.480 --> 10:06.560
Please don't hold this against me. Against me.

10:06.560 --> 10:10.770
Kagura, we can share the meal coupons. Share them.

10:11.260 --> 10:13.800
No fair teaming up against me!

10:16.750 --> 10:19.510
Special... lunch...

10:21.100 --> 10:24.580
Don't be confused, Kagura!

10:26.900 --> 10:28.030
Damn.

10:28.030 --> 10:31.040
In the end, the princess just has to be me!

10:31.040 --> 10:32.660
Not if I can help it!

10:33.270 --> 10:35.280
Prism Kick!

10:36.630 --> 10:38.780
Ah, how cruel.

10:39.380 --> 10:43.320
The duel is on, and I'm desperate to win it.

10:43.320 --> 10:47.180
Priecia, I've got it!

10:47.180 --> 10:48.540
Can you forgive me?

10:49.620 --> 10:50.750
You're too slow.

10:51.730 --> 10:52.930
Okay.

10:52.930 --> 10:54.250
I understand.

10:58.470 --> 11:01.480
Hand over the armor.

11:10.340 --> 11:11.490
The winners are...

11:12.110 --> 11:15.530
Hyaweh the Prince and Filia the Princess!

11:17.370 --> 11:18.530
When did she...

11:18.970 --> 11:24.030
This decides it. Onii-chan will be the one to get Filia's first kiss.

11:25.900 --> 11:30.540
GAME OVER!!

11:31.670 --> 11:33.250
It's over...

11:50.670 --> 11:52.130
Welcome, welcome.

12:11.150 --> 12:14.540
Oh, that's amazing! Amazing!

12:15.290 --> 12:19.500
I'd like you to taste this scrumptious apple, miss.

12:19.500 --> 12:21.700
Here you go. Say ah~

12:22.190 --> 12:24.050
What a lousy role this is!

12:25.600 --> 12:28.260
You mustn't waste stage props.

12:28.690 --> 12:30.390
Ah, sorry.

12:30.390 --> 12:32.820
Well, I understand how you feel.

12:32.820 --> 12:36.160
I'm only one of the seven dwarves.

12:36.160 --> 12:37.590
Good for you.

12:37.590 --> 12:40.320
I'm the mirror. The mirror!

12:40.770 --> 12:42.950
I'm just the head of a horse.

12:42.950 --> 12:45.070
And I'm the butt...

12:45.070 --> 12:47.330
At least give us human roles!!

12:47.970 --> 12:50.230
Have I been defeated?

12:50.230 --> 12:51.330
Priecia.

12:51.890 --> 12:53.610
Filia.

12:53.610 --> 12:56.330
Ah, that costume suits you well.

12:56.950 --> 13:00.550
Thank you. However, it seems a bit over sized for Filia.

13:01.230 --> 13:05.150
Shine as brightly as you can on that glorious stage.

13:05.150 --> 13:07.800
I'll be supporting you.

13:07.800 --> 13:12.560
Ah, Priecia, could it be that you're lying? Am I right?

13:12.980 --> 13:14.530
W-What?

13:14.530 --> 13:18.860
Still, I understand your feelings very well.

13:18.860 --> 13:20.290
So...

13:23.660 --> 13:28.940
And now, the play performed
by the honorable PPP,

13:28.940 --> 13:33.290
<i>The Sleeping Beauty -- Snow Cinderella White,</i> will begin.

13:36.570 --> 13:37.770
Once upon a time,

13:37.770 --> 13:42.850
there was a beautiful princess named Snow Cinderella White.

13:42.850 --> 13:46.260
The princess fell in love with the prince
of the neighboring country.

13:46.260 --> 13:48.200
One day...

13:49.300 --> 13:51.470
Eh? Isn't she...

13:51.900 --> 13:52.720
Priecia?

13:54.250 --> 13:59.560
Everything will be fine. Filia will feed her
all of the princess's lines.

14:00.300 --> 14:01.750
Oh?

14:01.750 --> 14:05.260
Is it okay that they have changed the PPP?

14:05.260 --> 14:07.570
Let's see how things play out.

14:08.160 --> 14:11.830
C-Cinderella, you're always so beautiful every time I see you.

14:11.830 --> 14:13.870
R-Really?

14:13.870 --> 14:16.330
Don't be shy. Just say your lines.

14:16.900 --> 14:18.410
I-I'm beautiful, you say?

14:18.410 --> 14:22.340
This is what happens to those who proffer shameless flattery!

14:26.640 --> 14:31.200
Due to her shyness upon meeting the prince,
the princess resorted to violence.

14:31.200 --> 14:32.350
What's going on?!

14:33.160 --> 14:35.040
This is Filia's suggestion.

14:35.040 --> 14:39.410
This is the only way I can be on the stage.

14:39.410 --> 14:41.860
The princess just simply has to be Priecia.

14:42.140 --> 14:47.590
Besides, Filia is thinking of
preserving her first kiss for later...

14:47.590 --> 14:49.980
Ah, what a pain!

14:48.240 --> 14:52.000
How do we express these feelings?

14:52.000 --> 14:57.450
The lovestruck princess
sneaks into the prince's castle.

14:57.450 --> 14:58.370
But...

14:58.370 --> 15:00.080
Hurry! They're raising the curtain!

15:02.260 --> 15:03.920
A thief!

15:03.920 --> 15:05.960
Show yourself!

15:05.960 --> 15:07.840
I'm not a suspicious person.

15:08.390 --> 15:11.250
No need... for excuses.

15:11.250 --> 15:14.350
You must be the assassin
who's after the prince's life!

15:14.350 --> 15:17.500
Taste my judgment! Judgment!

15:17.500 --> 15:19.850
Become the rust on my sword...

15:20.610 --> 15:23.740
That's not in my plans.

15:23.740 --> 15:25.570
Fear not. I used the flat of my blade.

15:26.230 --> 15:27.610
I'll avenge my servants!

15:33.500 --> 15:34.500
Wait!

15:34.500 --> 15:36.370
Glow Lash.

15:41.800 --> 15:44.420
Such exquisite swordsmanship...

15:44.580 --> 15:46.600
Ow...

15:46.600 --> 15:48.560
This was the ruffian's...

15:48.560 --> 15:50.380
Ah, what luscious curves!

15:51.800 --> 15:54.420
And that awe-inspiring figure...

15:54.420 --> 15:57.310
What is this feeling? My heart is pounding.

15:57.310 --> 15:59.600
Could this be that thing called... love?

16:00.560 --> 16:02.610
Such an explosive performance!

16:02.610 --> 16:05.550
But there is still more yet to be expressed!

16:05.550 --> 16:07.610
Am I right, Litte? Huh?

16:08.160 --> 16:11.320
Litte-dono has gone to the restroom.

16:14.320 --> 16:19.970
Ehh, for the audience's convenience,
we'll summarize the next part of the story.

16:19.970 --> 16:23.330
Snow Cinderella White was nearly killed by her step-mother,

16:23.330 --> 16:26.720
who was envious that her daughter's beauty outshone her own.

16:27.200 --> 16:30.380
Listen! My step-mother is after my life!

16:30.660 --> 16:34.590
She was saved by the
seven dwarves in the forest.

16:35.100 --> 16:40.330
Princess~ Princess~
Forest life isn't so bad, now is it?

16:40.330 --> 16:41.850
That's a tough call.

16:42.770 --> 16:44.810
However, her step-mother chased her down,

16:44.810 --> 16:47.650
and forced her to eat a poisoned apple.

16:47.650 --> 16:51.040
The Princess fell into a state of eternal sleep.

16:51.680 --> 16:55.320
Oh, no! If only we'd watched over her more closely!

16:59.610 --> 17:03.410
The queen cast a curse
to seal off the forest.

17:03.410 --> 17:08.940
The only thing that could save the princess was a kiss from a prince who truly loved her.

17:08.940 --> 17:13.380
Rumors of a princess sleeping in the forest
reached the prince's ears.

17:13.840 --> 17:17.630
Perhaps that princess
is the owner of this armor.

17:17.630 --> 17:21.210
It must be so. My pounding heart tells me this.

17:21.210 --> 17:25.400
I'm coming to save you now, my princess!

17:25.890 --> 17:27.830
Don't get too cocky!

17:27.830 --> 17:29.110
Don't underestimate us brambles!

17:38.440 --> 17:41.630
At last, the prince arrived at the princess's side.

17:41.630 --> 17:44.340
And now, the play has reached its climax!

17:44.340 --> 17:45.120
A perfect fit.

17:46.800 --> 17:49.380
Oh, Snow Cinderella White.

17:50.000 --> 17:53.690
Never did I imagine that the one I loved was you.

17:53.690 --> 17:59.800
If you truly do love her, please kiss her.

17:59.900 --> 18:01.390
I understand.

18:03.260 --> 18:09.400
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

18:17.540 --> 18:20.160
How could you ruin this chance by kissing her on the forehead?

18:20.520 --> 18:24.020
The princess awakens to the prince's tender kiss.

18:24.020 --> 18:25.370
Y-You scoundrel!

18:27.930 --> 18:33.290
I was forced do that in order to wake you up.

18:33.290 --> 18:35.380
I had no choice!

18:35.380 --> 18:36.590
No choice...

18:37.310 --> 18:42.330
Why did you kiss me if you don't love me?

18:42.330 --> 18:45.540
How could you do that?

18:45.540 --> 18:47.020
That...

18:47.570 --> 18:49.860
Do you only care about me...

18:49.860 --> 18:52.940
because I'm the princess?

18:53.400 --> 18:56.610
Eh? I didn't write those lines.

18:57.500 --> 18:59.320
Y-You're wrong! I...

19:00.020 --> 19:02.680
Then I ask you.

19:02.680 --> 19:04.620
Do you love me?

19:04.720 --> 19:07.620
Prie— I mean, Princess...
why do you ask me this so suddenly?

19:09.350 --> 19:11.700
I-I love you.

19:12.870 --> 19:14.480
I see.

19:14.480 --> 19:16.840
I love you, too.

19:16.840 --> 19:19.630
Can you kiss me again?

19:19.730 --> 19:20.840
Eh?

19:21.340 --> 19:22.850
Your lines, your lines!

19:23.710 --> 19:27.350
Can you kiss me again?

19:43.700 --> 19:45.660
What a fabulous kiss!

19:46.250 --> 19:49.180
Priecia, Hyaweh,

19:49.180 --> 19:51.280
this duel is a draw!

19:51.280 --> 19:52.880
Bravo, well-done!

19:57.130 --> 19:58.380
Priecia...

19:59.030 --> 20:00.680
Sorry.

20:00.680 --> 20:02.500
What happened to you?

20:02.500 --> 20:07.950
It was my fault you were wounded in the previous battle.

20:07.950 --> 20:09.720
Can you forgive me?

20:09.720 --> 20:11.050
What're you talking about?

20:11.050 --> 20:13.400
I never minded that at all.

20:13.900 --> 20:15.260
But...

20:15.260 --> 20:16.740
Forget about that.

20:16.740 --> 20:19.180
Your on-stage love confession was really touching.

20:19.180 --> 20:21.910
You and Onii-chan are very daring!

20:22.170 --> 20:25.040
Now, your relationship will be the talk of the school.

20:25.040 --> 20:26.910
Hyaweh...

20:35.770 --> 20:40.610
How could I allow my gluttony to compromise my mission?!

20:40.610 --> 20:44.370
Come to think of it, all the students are currently assembled in the theater.

20:44.370 --> 20:47.180
Now is the best chance to collect information.

20:47.180 --> 20:51.680
I must exploit this opportunity to uncover Hyaweh's secret. Exploit it.

20:52.990 --> 20:58.690
Even though this is my job, entering a boy's room is making me nervous. Nervous.

21:01.670 --> 21:03.340
Ms. Litte.

21:03.340 --> 21:06.670
Yes. The real Ala-Gladius...

21:06.670 --> 21:10.200
is a descendant of that race.

21:10.890 --> 21:14.210
The person you're searching for can only be Hyaweh.

21:15.730 --> 21:18.450
Could it be that in order to let Angel Phagiel...

21:18.450 --> 21:19.420
Phagiel...

21:20.930 --> 21:24.970
No. That is not the case.
Everything is proceeding as you wish.

21:25.660 --> 21:27.970
Commander Judas.

21:32.070 --> 21:33.440
Hyaweh,

21:33.440 --> 21:36.780
I have something I want to tell you, when we're alone.

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.910
Next Episode

23:16.070 --> 23:19.150
Hyaweh, it's time to resolve everything—

23:18.140 --> 23:20.700
I heard that General Viella will come.

23:20.700 --> 23:23.820
After this duel, I want you—

23:23.130 --> 23:25.710
I just can't wait for the graduation party!

23:26.240 --> 23:29.150
The Final Episode, The Knights' Ark.

23:29.540 --> 23:32.270
I'm also looking forward to
seeing you in a dress, Priecia.

23:32.730 --> 23:34.460
Can't you be serious for once?!

23:34.460 --> 23:36.450
Shine, the prism of heart!

23:34.510 --> 23:39.100
The Knights' Ark

23:36.450 --> 23:38.640
Hey, you don't get to say that!
